{"id":20267,"artist":"(Enlace Madonna: http://www.arrakis.es/~dabiel)","title":"Madonna: Drowned World / Substitute For Love","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:29.98] I traded fame for love\n[00:33.51] Without a second thought\n[00:36.16] It all became a silly game\n[00:39.91] Some things cannot be bought\n[00:43.21] Got exactly what I asked for\n[00:47.19] Wanted it so badly\n[00:50.71] Running, rushing back for more\n[00:54.69] I suffered fools\n[00:58.21] So gladly\n[01:04.61] And now\n[01:07.48] I find\n[01:13.21] I've changed my mind\n[01:20.41] The face of you\n[01:23.74] My substitute for love\n[01:27.07] My substitute for love\n[01:33.12] Should I wait for you\n[01:37.07] My substitute for love\n[01:40.41] My substitute for love\n[01:58.74] I travelled round the world\n[02:02.28] Looking for a home\n[02:05.41] I found myself in crowded rooms\n[02:08.95] Feeling so alone\n[02:12.07] Had so many lovers\n[02:15.41] Who settled for the thrill\n[02:18.74] Of basking in my spotlight\n[02:22.70] I never felt\n[02:26.03] So happy\n[02:33.88] The face of you\n[02:37.31] My substitute for love\n[02:40.74] My substitute for love\n[02:46.95] Should I wait for you\n[02:51.02] My substitute for love\n[02:54.45] My substitute for love\n[03:13.09] No famous places, far off places\n[03:16.95] Trinkets I can buy\n[03:19.95] No handsome stranger, heady danger\n[03:23.81] Drug that I can try\n[03:27.02] No ferris wheel, no heart to steal\n[03:29.77] No laughter in the dark\n[03:33.08] No one night stand, no far off land\n[03:36.00] No fire I can spark\n[03:42.82] Mmmmmmm mmmm mmmm\n[03:53.54] The face of you\n[03:56.65] My substitute for love\n[03:59.77] My substitute for love\n[04:03.08] Mmmmm\n[04:05.52] Should I wait for you\n[04:09.71] My substitute for love\n[04:13.24] My substitute for love\n[04:29.35] Now I find\n[04:35.91] I've changed my life, this is my religion\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:29.97] <00:29.97>I <00:30.42>tra <00:30.86>ded <00:31.30>fame <00:3